      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 75,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_student_04",
      "hash64": "FAD62753CBFFD1FB",
      "text": "Ah bon ? Bah, il fallait le dire ! J’ai cru que\\ntu allais vraiment tout casser, j’ai eu peur !",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_student_05",
      "hash64": "FAD62653CBFFD048",
      "text": "Alors, pour nous rejoindre, je pense que\\nça devrait être possible...",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_kakutou_04",
      "hash64": "BC38D491D225A84A",
      "text": "Ah, quelle bonne nouvelle !\\nPas vrai, Melo ?[VAR 0x0114(0022)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 44,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0022"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_hono_08",
      "hash64": "32C342E2DE9BBFA2",
      "text": "Non, attends. Ce gars a dit « ça devrait »...\\nQuoi ? Y a des conditions ? Une contrepartie ?[VAR 0x0114(001F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_student_06",
      "hash64": "FAD62953CBFFD561",
      "text": "Pas du tout ! Le club est ouvert à tous.\\c\\nC’est juste que... je suis curieux de connaître\\nla raison pour laquelle tu souhaites le rejoindre.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 40,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_hono_09",
      "hash64": "32C343E2DE9BC155",
      "text": "La raison...[VAR 0x0114(001F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_hono_10",
      "hash64": "32C6B0E2DE9EB063",
      "text": "Tu vois ces sapes et ces bottes ?\\nC’est un ami qui me les a fabriquées.[VAR 0x0114(001F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 71,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_hono_11",
      "hash64": "32C6AFE2DE9EAEB0",
      "text": "Ce design avec les flammes, j’le kiffe.\\nIl est vraiment trop chanmé.\\c\\nC’est pourquoi j’voudrais, moi aussi, créer\\nun design comme celui-ci.[VAR 0x0114(001F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 68,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 141,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_hono_12",
      "hash64": "32C6B2E2DE9EB3C9",
      "text": "Mais pour ça, j’dois apprendre à dessiner !\\nEt à peindre ![VAR 0x0114(001F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 58,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_hono_13",
      "hash64": "32C6B1E2DE9EB216",
      "text": "Par contre, j’suis vraiment une noob.[VAR 0x0114(001F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 37,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_hono_14",
      "hash64": "32C6B4E2DE9EB72F",
      "text": "Mais quand j’vois le Passerouge sur le mur,\\nj’me dis qu’on a pas besoin d’être doué\\r\\npour donner du style à une peinture.[VAR 0x0114(001F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 123,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
