      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_student_07",
      "hash64": "FAD62853CBFFD3AE",
      "text": "Euh... C’est moi qui l’ai dessiné...",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_hono_15",
      "hash64": "32C6B3E2DE9EB57C",
      "text": "C’est toi qu’as dessiné ça ?!\\nT’avais quel âge ? Cinq ans ?![VAR 0x0114(001F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
